This repository has two parts. Part 1 covers the words and pictures. Part 2 covers the
build script.


==============================================================================
PART 1. ENTRIES, CONCEPTS AND OTHER CONTRIBUTIONS
==============================================================================

Applies to everything in this repository except the files named in Part 2. That
includes every showcase entry (the entry.md files and their media), every concept
document under concepts/, the platform content under showcase/platform/, and the
Markdown documents at the root (README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, MEMBERS.md, SECURITY.md).

Each contributor keeps the copyright in their own contribution, and gives
DataCrafter Software Labs Pty. Ltd. the contribution licence set out in
CONTRIBUTING.md. That applies to every route: a pull request, an Issue, a
Discussion or a comment.

No licence is given to anyone else. You may read this material and link to it,
and quote from it as copyright law allows. To reuse more, ask the contributor or
DataCrafter Software Labs.

GitHub's Terms of Service separately let GitHub users view and fork public
content through GitHub itself. That is GitHub's rule, and it gives no other rights.


